Identify the change that was made in the SignalFlow to hide the plot:
To hide the plot, look in the publish() method; enable=True was changed to enable=False.
To hide the plot for "demo.trans.count" and to show the plot for "demo.trans.latency"
.:
A = data('demo.trans.count').publish(label='A', enable=False)
B = data('demo.trans.latency').publish(label='B', enable=True)
Show both plots and change plot name :
A = data('demo.trans.count').publish(label='Trans Count', enable=True)
B = data('demo.trans.latency').publish(label='Latency', enable=True)


